<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύρσις</span></b> , ἡ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Art.</u>
			43
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>An.</u>
			7.8.12
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(7).115.4
		</span></i> (Amorgos, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>); acc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύρσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					2.70
				</span></i>
			, Hp.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.8.13
			</span></i>: nom. and acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύρσεις,</span>
			gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εων</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσι</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				4.7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.10
			</span></i>; acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύρσιας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					834
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Maiist.
				2
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύρρις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (whence Lat. <i>turris</i> is
				borrowed):—<i>tower,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> l. c. (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).518
			</span></i>); esp. <i>tower on a wall, bastion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i> ll. cc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμαχών,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.4.3
			</span></i> sq.; also, <i>walled city</i> or <i>fortified house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; =
			<i>villa rustica,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργος,</span>
			<u>IG</u>l.c.</div>
